<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01469#audience_id> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The target community is individuals who are exposed to or consume hate speech and propaganda that promotes violence against Muslims, particularly those who may be influenced by or sympathetic to extremist ideologies that equate Muslim identity with terrorism or inherent threat. The meme is designed to appeal to or normalize such views by using violent, racist, and dehumanizing language and imagery, targeting those who might be receptive to or reinforce harmful stereotypes about Muslims and Muslim children."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#speechThoughtIntegratedWith> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#diegeticallyIntegratedWith> .
