<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01469#violent_metaphor_scene> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A scene depicting a heavily armed, masked soldier in a desolate environment, juxtaposed with text that reads 'when you punch the muslim kid so hard that he starts having seizures and fucking dies' and 'the bomb has been defused'. The scene uses the visual of a soldier to frame the act of punching a Muslim child as a 'solution' or 'defusal' of a threat, creating a violent, racist, and hateful analogy."@en .
