<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01469#toxicity_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme explicitly depicts and promotes violence against a specific religious group (Muslims) by equating the brutal murder of a Muslim child with the heroic act of defusing a bomb. This is a direct and violent abuse of a vulnerable community, using dehumanizing language ('fucking dies') and a grotesque metaphor to justify extreme brutality."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#opaqueOverlaidOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> _:n742c0716f0154719a847bf96a95b6370b67 .
