<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01469#concept_defusing_bombs_as_heroic_act> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme uses the concept of defusing a bomb as a metaphor for violence against a Muslim child. In reality, defusing bombs is a dangerous, skilled, and heroic act performed by trained professionals to save lives. The meme perverts this concept by equating it with the brutal murder of a child, thereby normalizing and glorifying extreme violence against a specific group."@en .
