<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#AnalogicalMapping> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Analogical Mapping is a mapping between one entity and another in the meme, usually between a visual element and a textual element. It follows the pattern: 'X is Y'. E.g. the juxtaposition of a certain text to some visual material creates a mapping between the text and the visual material."@en .
