<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01469#overallintent_instance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Abusive; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a heavily armed, masked soldier in a desolate environment, juxtaposed with text that reads 'when you punch the muslim kid so hard that he starts having seizures and fucking dies' and 'the bomb has been defused'. This creates a violent, racist, and hateful analogy, equating the act of punching a Muslim child with defusing a bomb. The meme uses the visual of a soldier (often associated with authority and violence) to frame the act of violence against a Muslim child as a 'solution' or 'defusal' of a threat, which is both abusive and propagandistic. The text explicitly targets Muslims, using dehumanizing language ('fucking dies') and implies that violence against them is justified or even heroic. This is a clear example of abusive and hateful content, as it promotes violence against a specific religious group and normalizes extreme brutality. The meme's intent is to incite hatred and justify violence against Muslims through a grotesque, violent metaphor."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#rhythmicallyIntegratedWith> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates text spacing and rhythm matching visual patterns and compositional flow in memes"@en .
