<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01469#soldier> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A heavily armed, masked soldier in full tactical gear, including a gas mask and helmet, holding a rifle. The soldier is the central visual focus, standing in a desolate, industrial-looking environment. The visual treatment is dark and gritty, emphasizing the soldier's imposing and threatening presence."@en .
