<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01469#hate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The emotion expressed is extreme hatred, conveyed through the violent and racist text that explicitly targets Muslim children and justifies their murder as a heroic act. The visual of the heavily armed soldier, often associated with authority and violence, reinforces this hateful sentiment by framing the act as a 'defusal' of a threat."@en .
