<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#semiTransparentOverlaidOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#superimposedOn> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01469#concept_tactical_gear_as_military_equipment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The soldier is wearing full tactical gear, which is standard equipment for military or special forces personnel. This is background knowledge that helps understand the soldier's role as a combatant or enforcer. The meme uses this visual to frame the act of violence as a 'military' or 'professional' act, thereby lending it an air of legitimacy or heroism."@en .
