<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01469#concept_industrial_environment_as_dangerous_setting> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The desolate, industrial-looking environment in the image is a background setting that implies danger, decay, or conflict. This is background knowledge that helps understand the context of the scene. The meme uses this setting to create a sense of danger or threat, which is then used to justify the violent act described in the text."@en .
