<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#DirectSuperimposition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Text or elements directly overlaid on top of other content in memes"@en .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01469#concept_death_as_final_state> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text explicitly states 'fucking dies', which is a direct reference to the finality of death. This is background knowledge that allows the reader to understand the violent and fatal outcome described in the text. The meme uses this to emphasize the brutality of the act and the finality of the child's death."@en .
