<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01469#stereotype_muslim_kids_as_vulnerable_targets> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme targets Muslim children specifically, implying they are 'bombs' that must be 'defused' by violent means. This is a grotesque and dehumanizing stereotype that reduces a child's humanity to a threat to be eliminated. It is rooted in the broader racist and Islamophobic trope that Muslim children are inherently dangerous or need to be controlled through violence."@en .
_:n742c0716f0154719a847bf96a95b6370b12 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
