<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#Object-embedded> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Object-embedded"@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#compositionallyIntegratedWith> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01469#assertion_about_01469> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general#hasToxicityExplanation> "The meme explicitly depicts and promotes violence against a specific religious group (Muslims) by equating the brutal murder of a Muslim child with the heroic act of defusing a bomb. This is a direct and violent abuse of a vulnerable community, using dehumanizing language ('fucking dies') and a grotesque metaphor to justify extreme brutality."@en .
