<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01469#concept_seizures_as_medical_condition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text mentions 'starts having seizures' which is a real medical condition. The meme uses this to imply that the child's death is a direct result of the punch, which is a grossly inaccurate and cruel fabrication. This is background knowledge needed to understand the absurdity and cruelty of the metaphor, as it falsely equates a medical condition with a violent act."@en .
